}{T_{i}^{2}} L_{i}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 然后求平均 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\bar{g} = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{n} g_{i} (n"},{"type":"text","value":" 为测量次数)作为测量结果; 乙同学以 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 为横坐标, "},{"type":"math","value":"T^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为纵坐标作 "},{"type":"math","value":"T^{2}-L"},{"type":"text","value":" 图线, 求斜率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" , 得到重力加速度测量值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = \\frac{4\\pi^{2}}{\\alpha}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。其中 （填空）（选填“甲”或“乙”）处理方法更合理, 理由是（填空）A. 减小偶然误差\nB. 可以消除误将 N-1 次全振动记为 N 次引进的系统误差\nC. 可以消除测量摆长的系统误差\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/56f0a6443352194f0071ee62df63e820e3942bf1569111cb51bcebc3c98f0bff.png","width":380,"height":291,"width_mm":44.534,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-I（3）题图 2\n"},{"type":"math","value":"16"},{"type":"text","value":"-II.（5分）小明测量一捆长约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"100\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的铜导线的实际长度（已知铜的电阻率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.75\\times 10^{-8}\\Omega \\cdot \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）。\n（1）测得导线的直径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.000\\mathrm{mm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，从测得的结果可推知该同学所用的实验仪器是（填空）A.毫米刻度尺 B.10分度游标卡尺 C.20分度游标卡尺 D.螺旋测微计\n（2）小明设计了如图所示测量电路，电源E为两节干电池， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示待测铜导线电阻，定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}=4.3\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。根据估算，测量误差更小的连接方法是接线端a（填空）（选填“1”、“2”或“3”），限流电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的作用是（填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c020e57fc280947fbce07495dee0541b7b1b2c901d76df53618c5a4f8e8fd3df.png","width":329,"height":211,"width_mm":38.645,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-II（2）题图 1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7b37ab2a210c56e8a5af24eca98253fc742752ce75840b3914244ae1e7d8e91a.png","width":344,"height":189,"width_mm":40.301,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-II（3）题图2\n（3）调节滑动变阻器，当电流表的读数为0.40 A 时，电压表示数如图2所示，读数为 （填空）V.\n(4) 导线实际长度为 （填空）m（保留2位有效数字）。\n"},{"type":"math","value":"16"},{"type":"text","value":"-III.（4分）某兴趣小组设计了如图1所示的测量交流电频率的实验。金属丝一端用钉子固定在水平桌面上，另一端通过滑轮系一重物 "},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":" ，在桌面上放置间距可调两枚契子。一蹄形磁铁产生方向垂直纸面向里的磁场。频率待测的交流电源（降压到安全电压以下）通过细软导线和滑线变阻器与金属丝连接。闭合开关S，调节两契的间距，在两契间可观察到如图2所示的振动图线。这一振动图线是由振动源（蹄形磁铁处）沿金属丝传播，然后通过两契子的反射形成相向传播的两列波叠加形成的。\n（1）已知波在金属丝中的传播速度只与悬挂重物的重力 G 和金属丝的线密度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":" （单位长度的质量）有关，则波速为 （填空）A. "},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\sqrt{\\frac{G}{\\mu}}"},{"type":"text","value":" B. "},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{\\sqrt{G}}{\\mu}"},{"type":"text","value":" C. "},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mu}{G}}"},{"type":"text","value":" D. "},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{\\mu}{\\sqrt{G}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）现测得两契子间距为 l，如图所示，则交流电的频率为 f = （填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8fb9c758d919f48f9c326707dd8f5bca71e472e52f98b804bd92ab3ceecc4bdd.png","width":816,"height":236,"width_mm":95.956,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-III（2）题图 1\n（3）如果增加 G,要得到类似如图的振动图线，则（填空）A. 滑片 P 向右移动 B. 增加两契间距 C. 滑片 P 向左移动 D. 减小两契间距\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/169c7965c7d09713fefdf7c219235154b32800edc329596634424fbd9acd5f0b.png","width":509,"height":177,"width_mm":59.807,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-III（3）题图 2"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 实验题（本题共 3 小题，共 14 分）\n16-I.（5分）\n(1) C 1分\n(2) C 1分\n(3) 1.215 或 1.220 或 1.225 1分\n(4) 乙 1分, C 1分 2分\n16-II.（5分）\n(1) D 1分\n(2) 2 1分，（限流）保护电流表 1分 2分\n(3) 2.60 (2.59～2.61) 1分\n(4) 99 ("},{"type":"math","value":"98 \\sim 1.0 \\times 10^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":") 1分\n16-III. (4 分)\n(1) A 1分\n【解析】选项A的单位正确\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"f = \\frac{1}{l}\\sqrt{\\frac{G}{\\mu}}"},{"type":"text","value":"2分\n【解析】波长"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda=l"},{"type":"text","value":"，(2021年1月选择题考过类似的)，"},{"type":"math","value":"f=\\frac{v}{\\lambda}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3) B\n【解析】波速增加，频率不变，波长增加 1 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5b2cd744c7f847c53394c6c6e89f4b09d9c643d5649935c4900395f010de4842","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （8分）如图所示，活塞 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 与汽缸 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 间密封一定质量的理想气体，轻弹簧一端与活塞 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 固定，另一端悬挂在天花板上。初始时，活塞 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 到汽缸底部的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 10.0\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，气缸 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 底部离地面距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 8.0\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，缸内气体的温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1} = 270\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知汽缸质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 2.0\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，活塞 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 的横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 1.0 \\times 10^{-3}\\mathrm{m}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.5\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，弹簧的原长 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{0} = 20\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、劲度系数 "},{"type":"math","value":"k = 2500\\mathrm{N / m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，活塞能无摩擦滑动，大气压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0} = 1.0 \\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求初始时汽缸内气体压强；\n（2）对汽缸缓慢加热，求：\n①当汽缸底部恰好与水平地面接触时，该过程气体内能变化量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\mathrm{U} = 30.0\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，该过程气体向外吸收的热量为多少；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8db697a28eb9d67b36717bd3abbbf3e5f710597d233bf8ec2e63bb77f129c03e.png","width":203,"height":337,"width_mm":23.739,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n②当弹簧长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"19.0\\,\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，汽缸内气体的温度为多少；"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1 = 8.0\\times 10^4\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）①"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\mathrm{U} = 36.4\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"②"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{3} = 877.5\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解：(1) 以汽缸B为研究对象\n"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}S + Mg = P_{0}S"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1} = 0.8 \\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa} = 8 \\times 10^{4}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(2) ① 汽缸缓慢下移，等压变化\n"},{"type":"math","value":"W = P_{1}S \\cdot h = 6.4\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"，对外做功取负号 1分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 30 + 6.4 = 36.4(\\mathrm{J})"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n② 整体法知"},{"type":"math","value":"kx_{1} = (M+m)g"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1} = 1\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n若"},{"type":"math","value":"L = 19\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则活塞上升"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n此时活塞为研究对象\n"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\Delta x + mg + P_{0}S = P_{2}S"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{2} = 1.3 \\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_{1}SL}{T_{1}} = \\frac{P_{2} \\cdot S \\cdot (L + h + 2x_{1})}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2} = 877.5\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c2de9001c2b877c141513f1c459c0f84f0ccaff7e553f68b29dc33b1011795e0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）在竖直平面内轨道 ABC、ADEFC 和水平直轨道 AG 在 A、C 处平滑连接，其中 ADEFC 为位于 ABC 下方半径为 R 的螺旋圆形轨道，其最高处与 AG 沿延长线相切；AG 左端固定一劲度系数 k=4N/m 的轻弹簧，右端系一质量 m=1kg 的滑块 Q，弹簧处于原长状态时 Q 位于 A 处。现有一质量也为 m 的滑块 P 从离 AG 高 h=0.2m 的 C 处以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 下滑，滑块与 AG 间的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":" ，轨道 ABC、ADEFC 光滑。已知当弹簧形变量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，其势能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}k\\Delta x^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，弹簧均在弹性限度内，不计滑块的厚度以及其它阻力，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10\\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=0,\\mu=0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，P、Q间的碰撞是弹性的，求弹簧的最大压缩量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2) 若 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = \\sqrt{12}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}, \\mu = 0.1"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块不进入螺旋圆形轨道，P、Q 碰后紧贴在一起运动，但互不粘连，求弹簧最大压缩量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x'_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和整个过程系统消耗的机械能；\n（3）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.1"},{"type":"text","value":" ，P、Q碰后紧贴在一起运动，但互不粘连，滑块P恰能沿轨道ADEFC返回且上升到 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求P的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 以及螺旋圆形的半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/619f9ba47c9f68d2863905e110d7a112e59ed408c2bed242693119ed8b9ba2cb.png","width":711,"height":348,"width_mm":83.608,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":