","fingerprint":"9bf1aeedacddb573f43c60771c3bbd8653d5147f87623eb9b3118dc02c29bb36","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）在竖直平面内有两条与水平线成 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 角对称的倾斜导轨，如图所示，导轨上端用直导线与内阻可忽略不计的电源相连，导轨下端断开。整个导轨位于方向垂直竖直平面向外、大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的导体棒处于水平状态，与导轨良好接触并能保持水平状态沿导轨光滑滑行。已知导体棒的截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计其它电阻，不考虑回路电流产生磁场对原磁场的影响。导体棒从静止开始释放，\n（1）若导体棒仍保持静止，求电源电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，并判定电流方向；\n（2）若导体棒在释放前已在导轨下端断开处接入一体积很小的电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R'"},{"type":"text","value":" ，导体棒将如何运动？\n（3）施以外力 F 使导体棒从某时刻 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 开始以速度 v 匀速向下运动，到达位置 R' 时为时刻 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。求时刻 "},{"type":"math","value":"t(t_{0} < t < t_{1})"},{"type":"text","value":" ：\n①导体棒感应电动势的大小;\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3c7d73932ae72e5671f45270817515df213d6f0d472e996d80147bdf76480d7d.png","width":419,"height":421,"width_mm":49.134,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第19题图\n② 施加的外力 F。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19.（11分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {0} = \\frac {U _ {0}}{R} \\qquad R = \\rho \\frac {l _ {0}}{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"①"},{"type":"math","value":"F _ {A} = B l _ {0} I _ {0} = m g"},{"type":"text","value":"②"},{"type":"math","value":"U _ {0} = \\frac {\\rho m g}{B S}"},{"type":"text","value":"方向：从左向右\n③\n(2) 流过棒的电流不变, 棒仍静止\n④"},{"type":"math","value":"E = B l v"},{"type":"text","value":"⑤"},{"type":"math","value":"l = \\frac {2 v (t _ {1} - t)}{\\tan \\theta}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑥"},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac {2 B v ^ {2} (t _ {1} - t)}{\\tan \\theta}"},{"type":"text","va